{"id":"2ebjEWk4E4I","video":{"id":"2ebjEWk4E4I","title":"[참치김치찌개] 7분이면 끝! 이대로 따라 만들면 맛있는 찌개 완성! / 참치캔 요리, 참치찌개 Tuna Kimchi-jjigae(Kimchi Stew)","channel":"이 남자의 cook","views":3396759,"duration":181,"thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/2ebjEWk4E4I/hqdefault.jpg","description":"딱 7분 만에 맛있는 찌개가 완성됩니다!\n찌개에는 시간 투자하지 마시고\n다른 반찬 만드세요.\n\n칼칼하고 감칠맛있어서\n밥 두 공기는 눈 깜짝할 사이에 사라지는\n'참치김치찌개'\n\n마땅한 반찬이 생각나지 않을 때\n끓여보세요!\n\n\n-------------- 재료 ------------\n신김치 400g(1/8포기)\n참치캔 1캔 200g\n대파\n청양고추 1개\n두부 반모\n고추장 1스푼(25g)\n고춧가루 1스푼(7g)\n양조간장 1스푼(10g)\n다시다 1작은스푼(4g)\n후추가루\n\n#참치찌개\n#김치찌개\n#참치캔요리\n#자취요리"},"recipe":{"title":"7분 참치김치찌개","summary":"김치를 고추장·간장·참치 기름에 센불로 볶아 수분을 날린 뒤 끓여 7분 만에 완성하는 참치김치찌개.","servings":2,"cook_minutes":10,"tools":["냄비"],"ingredients":[{"name":"신김치","qty":400,"unit":"g","price_krw":2000,"coupang_url":"https://link.coupang.com/a/iqwDAhMbBY"},{"name":"고추장","qty":1,"unit":"큰술","price_krw":200,"coupang_url":"https://link.coupang.com/a/iqwjtm4v00"},{"name":"양조간장","qty":1,"unit":"큰술","price_krw":100,"coupang_url":"https://link.coupang.com/a/iqwwTwHyVg"},{"name":"참치캔","qty":200,"unit":"g","price_krw":2500,"coupang_url":"https://link.coupang.com/a/iqwDAklEUC"},{"name":"물","qty":600,"unit":"ml","price_krw":0,"coupang_url":"https://link.coupang.com/a/iqwiUIRsBM"},{"name":"고춧가루","qty":1,"unit":"큰술","price_krw":150,"coupang_url":"https://link.coupang.com/a/iqwDzS5rFI"},{"name":"다시다","qty":1,"unit":"작은술","price_krw":100,"coupang_url":"https://link.coupang.com/a/iqwDAn2vRI"},{"name":"대파","qty":null,"unit":"한 줌","price_krw":300,"coupang_url":"https://link.coupang.com/a/iqwDAaHmKG"},{"name":"청양고추","qty":1,"unit":"개","price_krw":200,"coupang_url":"https://link.coupang.com/a/iqwDAd5Liu"},{"name":"두부","qty":0.5,"unit":"모","price_krw":700,"coupang_url":"https://link.coupang.com/a/iqwDArqx2a"},{"name":"후추가루","qty":null,"unit":"약간","price_krw":20,"coupang_url":"https://link.coupang.com/a/iqwDAtZ1kO"}],"steps":[{"text":"신김치를 가위로 손가락 한 마디 크기로 잘라 냄비에 넣는다.","start_sec":7,"ingredients":["